1
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,000
THE OPENING

2
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:54,900
"First found by: a worker, name unknown"
(Fictional document)

3
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:57,800
Kim Dong-su

4
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:01,400
We can't change the record.

5
00:01:02,300 --> 00:01:06,700
I know. Just let him go in
with us this time.

6
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:25,800
Three years.

7
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:30,800
That day... in front of everyone,
I said I didn't know you.

8
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:37,900
Why didn't you say anything?
Not then. Not now.

9
00:01:38,300 --> 00:01:43,800
When the ground first opened...
I thought I had broken something.

10
00:01:44,300 --> 00:01:47,700
So you let me take it all alone?

11
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:52,900
I did.

12
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:35,400
Don't touch it.

13
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:03,000
It has... no eyes?

14
00:03:04,500 --> 00:03:08,300
Down here, it must find its way
by something else.

15
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:05,800
I dropped this that day...
and I wanted to run.

16
00:04:06,100 --> 00:04:08,900
But you're the one who found it.

17
00:04:09,100 --> 00:04:11,900
Back then... I thought I'd ruined it.

18
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:19,300
Wait.

19
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:34,300
Hae-in.

20
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:36,200
Yes.

21
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:40,600
I shouldn't have left you
alone that day.

22
00:04:57,200 --> 00:05:00,400
We'll enter it in the survey record.

23
00:05:10,300 --> 00:05:14,700
It was here all along...
Keep it here, in the record.

24
00:05:20,400 --> 00:05:24,600
"Fell during construction, 2005
— statement of Kim Dong-su"

25
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:44,600
Next time... I'll come first.

